@startuml
!include _style.puml
' 设计类图（三）：端口与实现 —— 依赖倒置，换供应商不动领域代码

package "领域层　声明的端口" as PORT {
  interface "ConflictRepository" <<repository>> {
    + findByPair(userId : String, key : String) : Conflict
    + upsert(c : Conflict) : Conflict
  }
  interface "LLMJudgePort" <<interface>> {
    + judge(a : Claim, b : Claim) : Judgment
  }
}

package "基础设施　外层实现" as INFRA {
  class "SqlConflictRepository" <<repository>> {
    - session : Session
    - userId : String
    + findByPair(userId : String, key : String) : Conflict
    + upsert(c : Conflict) : Conflict
  }
  class "ModelGateway" <<service>> {
    - chain : List<LLMProvider>
    + judge(a : Claim, b : Claim) : Judgment
    + chat(task : String, prompt : String) : String
  }
  interface "LLMProvider" <<interface>> {
    + complete(req : Request) : Response
  }
  class "DeepSeekProvider" <<adapter>> {
    + complete(req : Request) : Response
  }
}

SqlConflictRepository .up.|> ConflictRepository
ModelGateway .up.|> LLMJudgePort
ModelGateway "1" o-- "0..*" LLMProvider : 策略链
DeepSeekProvider .up.|> LLMProvider

note bottom of DeepSeekProvider
  领域只认 LLMJudgePort 这个接口；
  网关 + 策略 + 供应商适配在基础设施层落地，
  换模型或加降级不改领域代码（ADR-03）。
end note

@enduml
